  "name": "Black Widow Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have only a single [One-Handed] weapon with the [Light] tag equipped to a [Hand Slot]. You gain a +[[DEX Mod] x 2] bonus to [Attack Power]. You gain a +[SRx5] bonus to damage rolls made while [Hidden].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that manipulates well-handled weapons and unleashes powerful blows from the enemy's blind spots.</p>",
